# Paths chezmoi must NOT write on this machine.

# ── GTK/Qt: manage the settings, never the generated colours ─────────────────
# This block INVERTED when Plasma went away, so the reasoning is worth keeping.
#
# Under KDE, kde-gtk-config's kded module (gtkconfig.so) regenerated the whole
# GTK config from the live Plasma colour scheme on every scheme change -
# verified: gtk-4.0/gtk.css, gtk-4.0/colors.css, gtk-3.0/colors.css and
# .gtkrc-2.0 were all rewritten within milliseconds of each other at login. So
# a chezmoi-managed copy was silently clobbered and looked like a theming bug,
# and the whole directory had to be ignored.
#
# Under niri there is no kded and nothing regenerates anything, so the old rule
# would leave GTK apps on unthemed Adwaita forever - the same symptom from the
# opposite cause. What DOES write colours now is Noctalia's GTK template, which
# emits noctalia.css and imports it into gtk.css. So the split is:
#   Noctalia owns colour   -> ignored here (generated, and it would fight us)
#   chezmoi owns behaviour -> gtk-3.0/settings.ini and gtk-4.0/settings.ini
.config/gtk-3.0/gtk.css
.config/gtk-3.0/colors.css
.config/gtk-3.0/noctalia.css
.config/gtk-4.0/gtk.css
.config/gtk-4.0/colors.css
.config/gtk-4.0/noctalia.css
.config/qt6ct
# .gtkrc-2.0 stays ignored permanently: nothing left after the migration is a
# GTK2 app, so managing it would buy nothing and would only pick a fight with
# kde-gtk-config while Plasma is still installed for the prototype phase.
.gtkrc-2.0
.gtkrc-2.0.mine

# ── Runtime / machine-local state, never source-controlled ───────────────────
.config/chezmoi
# NB: this also covers ~/.local/state/noctalia/settings.toml - the layer
# Noctalia's Settings GUI writes, which loads LAST and beats the config.toml
# this repo manages. Correctly excluded: a file the app rewrites on every click
# is not a dotfile. scripts/doctor.sh warns when it is non-empty so the drift
# stays visible; promote what you want to keep into config.toml.
.local/state

# ── Secrets: generated per machine by scripts/secrets-setup.sh, never stored ──
.ssh
.config/gh
.npmrc
.nuget
.docker/config.json

# ── Desktop-conditional ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
{{ if ne .desktop "niri" }}
.config/niri
.config/noctalia
.config/xdg-desktop-portal
{{ end }}
{{ if ne .desktop "hyprland" }}
.config/hypr
{{ end }}
